{"D:\\wt\\sachiko4\\vlog\\sachiko4\\voz\\b021_t2.wav": {"text": "Stop when it is hot all the way through and fluff it with the paddle. The water and the steam bring it back. I want to say one thing about the reheating because it is the rule that keeps people safe. Reheated rice must be steaming hot all the way through, not warm, steaming. If you cannot see the steam coming out of the middle, heat it a little longer and stir it once in the middle to check. A safe temperature is 165 degrees Fahrenheit, which is 74 degrees Celsius. Use a thermometer if you have one. If you do not, use your eyes and make sure the middle is steaming. The sixth problem is the one people never expect. Rice tastes too bland. This happens when the rice is not seasoned at all or the water was too much, so the flavor washed out into the water. A pinch of salt in the cooking water changes everything.", "words": [{"w": " Stop", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.42}, {"w": " when", "s": 0.42, "e": 0.64}, {"w": " it", "s": 0.64, "e": 0.8}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.8, "e": 1.0}, {"w": " hot", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.34}, {"w": " all", "s": 1.34, "e": 1.78}, {"w": " the", "s": 1.78, "e": 1.92}, {"w": " way", "s": 1.92, "e": 2.14}, {"w": " through", "s": 2.14, "e": 2.5}, {"w": " and", "s": 2.5, "e": 2.96}, {"w": " fluff", "s": 2.96, "e": 3.28}, {"w": " it", "s": 3.28, "e": 3.48}, {"w": " with", "s": 3.48, "e": 3.66}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.66, "e": 3.88}, {"w": " paddle.", "s": 3.88, "e": 4.16}, {"w": " The", "s": 4.68, "e": 4.9}, {"w": " water", "s": 4.9, "e": 5.24}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.24, "e": 5.56}, {"w": " the", "s": 5.56, "e": 5.82}, {"w": " steam", "s": 5.82, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " bring", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.38}, {"w": " it", "s": 6.38, "e": 6.64}, {"w": " back.", "s": 6.64, "e": 6.92}, {"w": " I", "s": 7.08, "e": 7.22}, {"w": " want", "s": 7.22, "e": 7.44}, {"w": " to", "s": 7.44, "e": 7.66}, {"w": " say", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.86}, {"w": " one", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.24}, {"w": " thing", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.5}, {"w": " about", "s": 8.